    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d461-a1">

                <pb facs="1250" n="1244" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg1244"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-11-23"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tuesday</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">November 23</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The executive and advisory councils met at 1:30 this afternoon, President Dole in
                    the chair. The members present were: Ministers King, Damon, and Smith, and
                    Councilors Hatch, Ena, Brown, Waterhouse, Emmeluth, Tenney, Wilder, Young,
                    Allen, Morgan, and Mendonca. Minister of Finance Damon then presented his weekly
                    report, as follows:</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Finance statement for week ending
                        November 23, 1893</hi>.</p>
