                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Expenses Provisional Government
                        memorandum</hi>.</p>
                <table cols="2" rows="1">
                    <row>
                        <cell>Expenses Provisional Government this date</cell>
                        <cell role="num">$159,954.21</cell>
                    </row>
                </table>
                <p>This amount covers all expenses, including military and items not appropriated by
                    the last legislature.</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum cash in treasury
                        outstanding</hi>.</p>
                <table cols="2" rows="10">
